  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of up to USD 25 million loan to Aya Gold &amp;amp;amp; Silver Inc. to support its  exploration programme at Boumadine. The transaction presents another  opportunity to support the Company, which is an existing client of the EBRD via  USD 100 million project finance loan provided for expansion and upgrade of  Aya&apos;s Zgounder silver mine in Morocco.  The project will enable to support an independent mining company in Morocco to  diversify its portfolio and expand its production capabilities beyond the  established Zgounder silver mine.</narrative>
  </description>
